---
import { AlertTriangle, Ban, CheckCircle2, Scale, ShieldCheck } from 'lucide-astro';

import Layout from '../layouts/PrimaryLayout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Acceptable Use Policy | TweakMart"
	description="The rules governing acceptable use of the TweakMart website, services and technology platform."
>
	<section class="border-b border-slate-200">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 md:py-20 xl:px-8">
			<div class="max-w-3xl">
				<div
					class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-blue-700"
				>
					<ShieldCheck class="size-4" />
					Platform Guidelines
				</div>

				<h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">
					Acceptable Use Policy
				</h1>

				<p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-600">
					This policy explains how TweakMart may and may not be used and helps us maintain a secure
					and reliable technology commerce platform for everyone.
				</p>

				<p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500">Effective date: 8 September 2026</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="bg-white">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 md:py-16 xl:px-8">
			<div
				class="rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50 p-5 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-700"
			>
				TweakMart is a product of
				<strong>CloudTweak Technologies Limited</strong>. By using TweakMart, you agree to use the
				platform lawfully and in accordance with this Acceptable Use Policy.
			</div>

			<div class="mt-12 space-y-12 text-[15px] leading-8 text-slate-600">
				<section>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<CheckCircle2 class="size-6 text-blue-600" />
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">1. Appropriate Use</h2>
					</div>

					<p class="mt-4">
						You may use TweakMart to browse and purchase products, request quotations, make
						legitimate business enquiries, request technical support, manage your orders and use
						other functionality we make available.
					</p>

					<p class="mt-4">
						Information you provide should be accurate, appropriate for the requested service and
						submitted in good faith.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<Ban class="size-6 text-red-500" />
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">2. Prohibited Activities</h2>
					</div>

					<p class="mt-4">You must not use TweakMart to:</p>

					<ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
						<li>• Engage in fraudulent, deceptive, unlawful or abusive activity.</li>
						<li>• Submit false orders, payment information, identities or business enquiries.</li>
						<li>
							• Attempt unauthorized access to accounts, databases, servers, APIs or other systems.
						</li>
						<li>• Introduce malware, malicious scripts, viruses or other harmful code.</li>
						<li>
							• Probe, scan, test or attempt to circumvent security or authentication mechanisms
							without authorization.
						</li>
						<li>
							• Scrape, crawl or automatically extract substantial platform data without our
							permission.
						</li>
						<li>
							• Interfere with the availability, performance or normal operation of TweakMart.
						</li>
						<li>
							• Abuse forms, APIs, support channels, promotional offers, checkout or payment
							systems.
						</li>
						<li>• Impersonate another individual, organization or TweakMart representative.</li>
						<li>• Infringe intellectual property, privacy or other legal rights.</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<AlertTriangle class="size-6 text-amber-500" />
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">3. Platform Security</h2>
					</div>

					<p class="mt-4">
						You must not deliberately attempt to defeat security, validation, fraud-prevention,
						rate-limiting, payment or access-control measures implemented by TweakMart.
					</p>

					<p class="mt-4">
						If you discover a suspected security vulnerability, please report it to us rather than
						exploiting it or accessing information beyond what is necessary to identify the issue.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">4. Account Responsibility</h2>

					<p class="mt-4">
						Where account functionality is available, you are responsible for maintaining the
						confidentiality of your credentials and for activity performed through your account,
						subject to applicable law.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">5. Enforcement</h2>

					<p class="mt-4">
						Where we reasonably believe this Policy has been violated, we may take proportionate
						steps including restricting functionality, cancelling fraudulent or abusive requests,
						suspending access, preserving relevant evidence or referring unlawful activity to
						appropriate authorities where required or permitted by law.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<Scale class="size-6 text-blue-600" />
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">6. Relationship to Other Terms</h2>
					</div>

					<p class="mt-4">
						This Acceptable Use Policy forms part of the rules governing use of TweakMart and should
						be read together with our
						<a href="/terms" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">
							Terms and Conditions
						</a>
						and
						<a href="/privacy" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">
							Privacy Policy
						</a>.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">7. Contact</h2>

					<p class="mt-4">
						If you have questions about this Policy or need to report suspected misuse of TweakMart,
						please
						<a href="/technical-support" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700"> contact us</a>.
					</p>
				</section>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
